# 1. PRODUCT BREAKDOWN

## Core Value Proposition

Vinopera acts as an **AI-OS** on a canvas that merges

Figma-like UI + tldraw infinite canvas + ChatGPT-like agent + file intelligence + code execution + collaboration.

A persistent contextual workspace powered by AI users never re-upload files; they build inside a visual AI-native environment.

---

## Core Product Modules

### 1. Canvas Layer (Visual Workspace)

- Infinite canvas
- Object model: blocks, shapes, frames, file cards, sticky notes, text blocks
- Figma/tldraw-like interactions (drag, resize, group, layer controls)
- Live AI overlays on canvas (summaries, insights, diagrams)

### 2. AI Agent Layer

- Context-aware chat based on the active canvas
- Memory system per canvas (vector store or hybrid)
- Auto-tagging and auto-embedding of every object or file
- Multi-agent tools:
    - Text generation
    - Summaries
    - YouTube or URL summarizer
    - Script generator
    - Research agent
    - Coding agent
    - Data/Excel agent
    - Graph/diagram generator
    - Meeting notes and Q&A

### 3. File Intelligence Layer

- Upload: PDF, DOCX, XLSX, PPT, TXT, CSV, Audio, Video
- Automatic parsing + chunking
- Visual file cards placed on canvas
- Ability to drag snippets from files into the canvas
- “Context mode” so AI can use these files without reuploading

### 4. Code Execution Layer

- In-browser sandbox or backend sandbox
- Python, JS, C++ basic execution
- Graph generation
- Data cleaning and transformation
- Display results back onto the canvas as widgets

### 5. Collaboration Layer

- Real-time multiplayer
- Comments, threads, tags
- Share links
- Export canvas to PDF/PNG/Notion/Docs
- Presentation mode

### 6. Content Creation Tools

- One-click blog, scripts, tweets, reports
- AI layout suggestions
- Visual templates library
- Brand style settings

### 7. Workspace OS Features

- Projects
- Versioning
- Autosave
- Search across all canvases
- Personal AI memory
- Asset library

