# 2. TECH BREAKDOWN

## Frontend

- Next.js or Remix
- tldraw (customized)
- TailwindCSS
- Zustand/Recoil for state
- WebAssembly sandbox (if client-side code execution)
- WebRTC for collaboration

## Backend

- Node.js or Go services
- LLM orchestrator (LangChain/LangGraph/own orchestrator)
- Vector DB: Pinecone, Weaviate, Chroma
- File extraction pipelines: pdf.js, unstructured.io, custom parsers
- Job system for heavy processing
- Realtime: Supabase Realtime / WebSocket server

## AI Layer

- OpenAI GPT-5/4.1/4o, Gemini 2.0 Flash/Pro, Claude
- Local models for summarization (optional)
- Chains for:
    - Auto chunking
    - Context selection
    - Retrieval
    - Agent routing
    - Output formatting

## Code Execution

Option A: Client-side pyodide/wasm sandbox

Option B: Server-side container-based executor (better reliability but costlier)

## Database

- PostgreSQL for users, sessions, projects
- Redis for cache
- S3 for file storage

